---LINES
ok	= gh - - - - "[ ok ]"
err	= gv - - - - "[ exit= 1 ]"
---SCREEN
=command run & exit code indicator

  when command completed, You get indicator in one of form:
  .ok...       -- on success
  .err........ -- if command terminates with error or on a signal

  Warning:
  .:NL... and some other codes takes a trap on this point, preventing mistakes
  
  Pass codes are:
  
  .:SP... returns to main menu
  .:AU... returns to command editor
	options: .:AL... cursor position restored
	         other printable keys start a command from scratch
  .:HE... get this page
  
---END
